  "body": "Quietly positioned and resolved over two levels, this Mission Bay townhouse is defined by clarity rather than noise. The architecture is purposeful, the spaces measured, and the setting unusually calm for such a connected address.\r\n\r\nKey features\r\n- Two level modern townhouse\r\n- Positioned well back from the road\r\n- Backing onto Kepa Bush Reserve\r\n- Open plan living and dining\r\n- Kitchen with island, feature benchtops and pantry storage\r\n- Three bedrooms total, two with built in wardrobes\r\n- Master suite with walk in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n- Full family bathroom\r\n- Concealed upstairs laundry\r\n- Front patio with mature hedging\r\n- Two dedicated off street car parks\r\n\r\nRemoved from the street and oriented toward Kepa Bush Reserve, the home prioritises outlook and privacy. The ground floor is composed and open, with living and kitchen forming a single, coherent space that extends naturally to the front patio. Materials and layout are confident but understated, favouring function and longevity over trend.\r\n\r\nUpstairs continues with the same discipline. The main bedroom faces the reserve and is paired with a walk in wardrobe and ensuite. Two further bedrooms, a family bathroom and a concealed laundry complete the level, all arranged with efficiency and minimal visual interruption.\r\n\r\nThe result is a home that feels settled and considered. Green at the edge, quiet in tone, and highly convenient, with Eastridge Shopping Centre nearby, beaches close, and the CBD within easy reach.\r\n\r\nView it. The design speaks for itself.\r\n\r\nAgents bring your buyers, we offer conjunctional from day one.\r\n\r\nDownload the property documents here: https://www.agentsend.com/NKSA\r\n\r\nhttps://www.diego.nz/13-245keparoad",
